---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Join"
  description="Contact CAV at director@thecav.org (Michael Evans Bird, Chair/President) to collaborate on research, practice, or support of the Center’s work."
>
  <PageHeader
    kicker="Correspondence"
    title="Write to the Center."
    lede="CAV is early. The useful letters will be precise: a concept, a corpus or method question, a practice setting, a correction, or a collaboration with a name attached."
  />

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-12 sm:px-8">
    <article class="measure prose-cav text-[1.05rem]">
      <p>
        Email
        <a href="mailto:director@thecav.org">director@thecav.org</a>.
        Correspondence is received by
        <strong>Michael Evans Bird</strong>, Chair/President of the Center.
        There is no form behind this page yet — a mailbox is enough, and it keeps the
        threshold honest.
      </p>

      <h2>Who should write</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Researchers, speakers, and practitioners who want a concept or tradition treated
          carefully — or left alone.
        </li>
        <li>
          Scholars in computational humanities, comparative philosophy, evolutionary
          ethics, linguistics, or theology interested in the research pillars or
          intended methods.
        </li>
        <li>
          Diplomats, mediators, and institutions with a live problem that generic values
          language is failing.
        </li>
        <li>
          Readers who have found an error and can show it.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What to include</h2>
      <p>
        Your name, affiliation if any, and the specific term, pillar, method, or setting.
        If you are writing about a community that is not yours, say so. If something on
        this site should be taken down, say that first.
      </p>
      <p>
        We read slowly. A reply is not a promise of partnership.
      </p>
    </article>

    <p class="mt-10">
      <a
        class="inline-block border border-ink bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 font-sans text-sm text-paper no-underline hover:bg-oxblood hover:border-oxblood"
        href="mailto:director@thecav.org"
      >
        Email director@thecav.org
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
